# Terraform state, plans and the backend file can hold secrets, addresses and the account id: they never go in
# git (docs/runbooks/terraform-production.md). Applies to both roots.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
*.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
backend.tf
# Encrypted state copies belong in the offline store, never here (runbook step 3.4).
tfstate-*.enc
*.enc
